@Confera.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7205
@roomId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@projectorId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@wifiId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# Set the host from the Aspire API resource. Replace IDs using the read-only
# query in docs/local-development.md#try-a-booking and choose an available future date.
# Zero IDs below are placeholders and intentionally rejected by the API.
# With the original Room A values, this returns 201 and a total of 9400 UAH.
# Use "serviceIds": [] for rental only (8600 UAH).
POST {{Confera.Api_HostAddress}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "start": "2030-01-15T11:00:00Z",
  "end": "2030-01-15T15:00:00Z",
  "serviceIds": ["{{projectorId}}", "{{wifiId}}"]
}

###

GET {{Confera.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
